{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""}]},{"chapter":"13","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""},{"verse":"22","text":""},{"verse":"23","text":""},{"verse":"24","text":"Therefore I shall scatter them like straw flying (lit.passing) in a desert wind."},{"verse":"25","text":""},{"verse":"26","text":""},{"verse":"27","text":""}]},{"chapter":"14","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},{"verse":"12","text":""},{"verse":"13","text":""},{"verse":"14","text":""},{"verse":"15","text":""},{"verse":"16","text":""},{"verse":"17","text":""},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":"Don't disgrace us for your namesake, don't dishonour your holy temple (lit.the seat of your glory). Remember -don't annul- your covenant with us."},{"verse":"22","text":"Are there among the vanities of the nations those that make rain, and is it the heavens that give raindrops, is it not that you are G-d our L-rd whom we hope in, for [it is] you who did all these [things]."}]},{"chapter":"15","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":"G-d said: I promise [that] I will spare you for good (kesiv: I will fortify you for good), at the time of evil and pain the enemy will encounter you (i.e.he will seek you to look after you)."},{"verse":"12","text":"Can iron (i.e. the assults on Yermiah from the populace) break iron from the North [mixed with] copper (i.e.Yermiah. see 1:18)?"},{"verse":"13","text":"I will hand over your wealth and your storehouses as a spoil, not in exchange for money, rather for your sins [perpetrated] throughout your borders."},{"verse":"14","text":"I will subjugate you to your enemies in a land you have not known, for an East wind as strong as fire has gone forth from before Me, amid anger, it shall burn against you. (Targum)"},{"verse":"15","text":"You know, O G-d (Remember me, look after me and avenge my pursuers for me, don't take my life due to your patience [for the enemy], know) [about] my bearing disgrace for your sake."},{"verse":"16","text":"I adhered to your edicts and I fufilled them (lit. Your words were found and I ate them) and your words were to me as a rejoicement and true happiness for [it showed that] Your Name -G-d L-rd of hosts- was proclaimed upon me."},{"verse":"17","text":"I did not sit among groups of merrymakers and make merry because of your hand (i.e. the prophecy that you showed me). I sat alone, for fury filled me [against the people]."},{"verse":"18","text":""},{"verse":"19","text":""},{"verse":"20","text":""},{"verse":"21","text":""}]},{"chapter":"16","verses":[{"verse":"1","text":""},{"verse":"2","text":""},{"verse":"3","text":""},{"verse":"4","text":""},{"verse":"5","text":""},{"verse":"6","text":""},{"verse":"7","text":""},{"verse":"8","text":""},{"verse":"9","text":""},{"verse":"10","text":""},{"verse":"11","text":""},